summary:
  An artist credit is not split at its commas, so a list of performers
  loses its first one.

history:
  Measured on 2026-11-03 against the recorded catalogue answers: with the
  comma stuck to the first name, "Pritam, Arijit Singh" and "David Guetta,
  Alphaville & Ava Max" no longer found the first artist's records.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SearchLogic.js

find:
      var parts = String(s === undefined || s === null ? "" : s).split(/\s*([,;\/\u00d7\u3001\uff06\uff0c])\s*/), out = [];

replace:
      var parts = String(s === undefined || s === null ? "" : s).split(/\s*([;\/\u00d7\u3001\uff06\uff0c])\s*/), out = [];

expect:
  Killed by tst_artpick::test_a_list_of_performers_still_holds_its_first_one.
  Line-neutral.
